{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5afc9efe-ad5d-8313-b5d3-ae4db288b82d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T11:38:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Sandra. My name is Odete Varela. I have a form here I need to hand in, and I wanted to know if somebody is at the front desk at lunchtime. It's going on noon now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, we've got somebody at the counter through lunch. We stagger it so the desk is never empty. Are you coming down to City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll come down. I take the bus from the North End, I'm on Van Zandt Avenue. Number 69. But I'm not in a hurry. I have all afternoon, so I can get there whenever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's good. No rush at all then. Do you know what kind of form it is? I can tell you if it goes to our counter or somewhere else in the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one that came in the mail, from the clerk's office. It has my name on top and a line for me to sign at the bottom. I filled it out already with the blue pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, if it came from us, then the clerk's counter is the right place. Just bring it in and they'll take it from you. Do you want to hold on to a copy for yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I don't have a copy machine. Would they do that there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise, but just ask at the counter. Most of the time they'll help you with that. Or you could take a picture with a phone, if you have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no phone like that. I have the house phone. I'll ask them at the desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Ask them nicely and they'll do what they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, what are your hours, the clerk's office? So I know. I don't want to come on the wrong day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open Monday through Friday, eight thirty in the morning to four thirty in the afternoon. Closed on weekends and holidays. Today is Wednesday, so you're fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight thirty to four thirty. Monday to Friday. Let me write that down. [pause] Okay. And lunch, they stay open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am. The counter stays open through lunch. Somebody's always there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I'll get the bus after I eat. I take the one that goes down the avenue and then along the boulevard, and I get off near the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds right. When you come in, the clerk's counter is just inside, you won't have to climb stairs. Is that okay for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good, because the stairs are not so good for me anymore. No stairs is good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No stairs, I promise. Just come straight in and look for the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Should I bring anything with the form? Like papers or identification?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a good idea to carry a photo ID, just in case they have a question. Other than that, if the form is filled out and signed, that should be all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I signed it. I have my ID, the license, in my bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then you're all set. If anything's missing, they'll tell you right there and you can fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I get there and the person is on the other side, in the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just wait a minute or ring the little bell if there is one on the counter. They'll come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll do that. Thank you, Sandra. You were very helpful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're very welcome, Mrs. Varela. Take care going down, and watch your step out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
